#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "572536"
msgid "Hey. Hurry setting it up, please.\nWhy are you being so sloppy?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "573028"
msgid "I can't plug an anti-#C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF driver\ninto an Arena of this scale."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "573616"
msgid "But, why is he―――!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "573648"
msgid "Hehe. Surprised? My #ROFS0001#RUBSShapeshifters#RUBEtentacles#REND do more\nthan just disassemble or absorb Servants."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "574044"
msgid "D-don't say something so stupid!\nYou're my Familiar! I don't need to tell you\nthat you have to fight!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "574296"
msgid "……!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "574392"
msgid "……!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "574748"
msgid "―――, ―――, ―――.\n…, …!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "574876"
msgid "―――.\n…, ………!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "575128"
msgid "―――."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
