#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "589928"
msgid "After making a shortcut to the old school from\nthe #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF, please return to base."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "590032"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, you appear to have accumulated\na lot of fatigue. I recommend that\nyou return for the moment to take a rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "590168"
msgid "I'm concerned about #C236196003Rin#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "590212"
msgid "Searching the Labyrinth is nice and all,\nbut I should #C000246204return to the old school#CDEF to\nbriefly speak with #C236196003Kiara#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "590352"
msgid "I obtained the first #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nLet's briefly return to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and sort\nout the situation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "590472"
msgid "First thing to do is activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF.\nThat'll help move our search along."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "590572"
msgid "We took more damage from our fight with #C236196003Lancer#CDEF\nthan I expected. Now would be a good time to head\nback to the old school.\nLuckily, there's a #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF near us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "590764"
msgid "What's wrong, Praetor?\nLet's #C000246204continue onward#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "590828"
msgid "Don't worry. I'll protect you, Darling.\nSo, continue on #C000246204ahead#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "590908"
msgid "Surely you're not telling me that you're\nfrightened? Even you understand that stopping\nhere is impermissible, yes?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "591024"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF. After you activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF,\nplease have yourself a rest in your\nprivate room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "591152"
msgid "Even in cyberspace, you need proper rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "591196"
msgid "Once you activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF,\nuse it to get back here.\nI'll bet you're exhausted, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "591324"
msgid "#[Mr.][Ms.]##C236196003 #NICK#CDEF, return to base for now.\nLet's discuss our plan\nin the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "591452"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, please come back.\nYou've accumulated a lot of fatigue;\nany more will be dangerous!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "591560"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF's worried state gets across to\nme even over the transmission."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "591648"
msgid "She's right, it would be best if\nwe returned to the #C000246204Old School Building#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "591740"
msgid "We obtained the #C000246204SG#CDEF. Let's return to the\n#C000246204Old School Building#CDEF for the time being.\nWe can come again after we recover."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "591888"
msgid "We got the #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nMission complete.\nLet's head home and get some rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "591972"
msgid "Where are you going? We secured the #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nThere's nothing urgent to tend to.\nBack to #C000246204My Room#CDEF, now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "592104"
msgid "Hrrrm? Where are you going, #C236196003#FAMILY\n#GIVEN#CDEF? Where are you going,\nleaving me behind?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "592204"
msgid "For a second there, I was thinking about\nleaving #C236196003Gatou#CDEF and heading back,\nbut it probably won't rest easy on my conscience,\nso let's turn back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "592364"
msgid "Wait, Praetor. If we're going to head back,\nit'll behoove us for the future to have\nthe #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF activated."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "592492"
msgid "Master, let's look for the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF.\nIt should be around here somewhere…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "592584"
msgid "We don't need to walk all the way back.\nWe can use the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF to reach the\nold school in a flash. Very nifty."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "592716"
msgid "M-my stomach is at its limit…\nI want to hurry back to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and get some rest…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "592816"
msgid "Before we go to the next floor,\nlet's #C000246204head back to the Student Council Room#CDEF.\nWe need to hand over the data we got from #C236196003Green Archer#CDEF.\nHe gave his life to entrust us with it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "593024"
msgid "Huh? You're still in the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF?\nCome on, there's nothing to do there.\nGet your butt back here!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "593148"
msgid "We'll talk about what comes next tomorrow,\nso #C000246204come back and get some rest#CDEF.\nAfter, drop by the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "593280"
msgid "We're in a race against time.\nWe need to hurry to the #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "593372"
msgid "I can't let #C236196003Shinji#CDEF's hopes go to waste.\nLet's press on so we can catch up to #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "593496"
msgid "Praetor, I've grown tired. Let us return\nto My Room and have ourselves a bath."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "593576"
msgid "I know how you feel, but knowing\nwhen to rest is also part of the battle.\nLet's head back to My Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "593680"
msgid "Darling, now is the time for rest.\nLet's return to our room and\nrecover our strength."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "593768"
msgid "What an impatient #[man][woman]#. Laboring away\nis not all there is to life, you know?\nWhen it's time to rest, rest."
msgstr ""

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "593888"
msgid "You may now save your current game data\n            as #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."
msgstr "Agora você pode salvar seus dados\n         como #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "593972"
msgid "     You may use this data to carry\nover elements to the start of a new game."
msgstr "     Você pode usar esses dados para levar\nelementos ao início de um novo jogo."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "594052"
msgid "Please be careful to not overwrite\n  the data while you are saving."
msgstr "Tome cuidado para não sobrescrever\n  os dados ao salvar."

#. unk_op1653
msgctxt "594120"
msgid "Would you like to save your Clear Data?"
msgstr "Deseja salvar seus Clear Data?"

#. popupSaveBeforeQuit_line1
msgctxt "594160"
msgid "Are you sure you wish to exit"
msgstr "Tem certeza de que deseja sair"

#. popupSaveBeforeQuit_line2
msgctxt "594192"
msgid "without saving the Clear Data?"
msgstr "sem salvar os Clear Data?"

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "594224"
msgid "Uhh, test, test.\n\"Since Senpai is such a dummy, #[he][she]#'ll probably\nstill be running circles around floor five☆\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "594344"
msgid "Since #C236196003BB#CDEF tried so hard to predict such,\nas soon as I looked at my monitor I went,\n\"Oh deary me.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "594460"
msgid "By some sort of luck, this bad #[boy][girl]# Senpai\nhas already made it to the goal.\nI'll be sending out the signal now～☆"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "594584"
msgid "No way! Forced again to sit through a video!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "594632"
msgid "I'm pretty sure that you of all people can set\nup a lot of harsher, nastier traps."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "594716"
msgid "It depends on the place and the cash.\nI'm no magus, y'know. With these sorry\nresources, this is the best I can do."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "594832"
msgid "And what do you mean by harsher, nastier?\nYou gonna prep some flashy explosives\nor a huge monster or something?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "594944"
msgid "There's all sorts stocked #RUBS   in the Near Side#RUBEup over there#REND, right?\nCan't you send over a few heavy duty tools?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "595072"
msgid "It's hard to do with the extent of my power.\nIt's like lining up little beads\nwith an excavator, you know?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "595180"
msgid "The right man for the right job, #C236196003Archer#CDEF.\nDelicate tweezers are the best thing for a\ndelicate set assembly, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "595312"
msgid "Yeah, yeah. Right guy, right job, thanks. But it\ndepends on the time and place. Look, while you\nwere being stingy, your guests arrived."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "595448"
msgid "!?\nImpossible―you can't even talk to each other,\nand you already made it here!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "595532"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF…!\nAnd beside her is, if I remember correctly―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "595604"
msgid "That's right, #C236196003Archer#CDEF.\nThe Servant I fought in the 2nd Round\nof the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF, back in the Near Side."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "595744"
msgid "The forest hunter;\nThe #RUBS     High Master #RUBEExcelled Expert#REND of poison and traps."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "595836"
msgid "I can revive Servants defeated in battle\nand make them work for me like this.\nIt's the age of recycling!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "595944"
msgid "Man. It's a big pain in MY ass, though.\nSo? What should we do, Sponsor?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "596016"
msgid "My job is just to set the traps. You haven't\nwritten any checks over being your guard.\nBecause of that, can I head home now?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "596144"
msgid "―――Ah, man. Well, I'm not that surprised."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "596192"
msgid "Sorry, #[lad][young lady]#. It's not like we don't know\neach other, but this is destiny.\nDie quick for me, won't you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "596312"
msgid "Ha! Of course THAT wouldn't work on you twice!\nLong time no see, princess!\nGrown up at all since last time?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "596420"
msgid "Ha! Of course THAT wouldn't work on you twice!\nI'm used to seeing your ugly mug now!\nYou'll make a fine target!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "596532"
msgid "Oh? Of course THAT wouldn't work on you twice.\nHas the fox woman, who's only interesting point\nis her curses, grown any since last time?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "596672"
msgid "Huh? What? \"My Praetor has become stronger,\ngo ahead and praise my skill\"?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "596748"
msgid "…*sigh*. This is all I get for learning how\nto read lips. Man, how boring."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "596824"
msgid "Who's talking about how buddy buddy you two are?\nHearing people's girl talk is just annoying.\nI was talking about your height, your chest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "596964"
msgid "But it's my fault for setting up that joke.\nGuess I just have to play dumb.\nClearly, you haven't grown a bit anywhere."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "597084"
msgid "Huh? \"The style of your traps is weak\"?\n\"Your skill has dropped, girly man\"?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "597164"
msgid "Obviously not, is what I want to say, but―――\nGosh darn, you hit where it hurts,\nmy fellow comrade."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "597268"
msgid "The reason is kinda poetic.\nMy lifestyle has taken a big turn.\nMy nasty traps are sealed, for now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "597368"
msgid "Hah. Keep talking, girly man…!\nEven if we get into a straight-up firefight,\nI won't be losing to you…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "597476"
msgid "Huh? What happened to those insults you'd\nalways throw around like a wild boar?\nWere you always the silent type?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "597592"
msgid "Come on. It's too late to change your act―or\nshould I say too late to get married? Your\nbelievers and marriage chances are fading."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "597724"
msgid "Putting on a mask to fix your character is\njust a waste of your time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "597796"
msgid "If you don't attack with sex appeal, you've got\nno chance, y'know? Since you're lying about\nyour age―it's got three digits."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "597924"
msgid "……! (Yep, I'm SUPER KILLING HIM!)"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "597960"
msgid "Hey, hey. I wasn't expecting a newcomer. I can\ntell you're an #C236196003Archer#CDEF, having figured out my\ntrajectory your first time seeing it, but――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "598116"
msgid "Nah, your system is something different.\nThough we both use magic bullets, yours\nare cannons; mine are cheap tricks."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "598236"
msgid "And we're real incompatible, terribly. I don't\nknow where you're a king of, but just looking at\nyour mug gives me the creeps!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "598364"
msgid "Ha! You've got it, #[lad][young lady]#!\nThe greenhorn's really been movin' up!\nMaster was right about you, after all!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "598484"
msgid "…!\nWhat's so fun about this, #C236196003Archer#CDEF?\nYou lost disgracefully!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "598564"
msgid "Hey now. Just WHO'S the one who took\naway my Noble Phantasm?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "598628"
msgid "If you want me to be #RUBS serious#RUBEearnest#REND about this,\nyou gotta give me back the power I blasted\nthem with before."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "598756"
msgid "Anyway, you're not acting very boss-like, #C236196003BB#CDEF.\nWhere'd that composure of yours run off to?\nYour personality changed, no?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "598892"
msgid "Hahaa… Then you must not be used to losing?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "598940"
msgid "The reason you're yelling at me isn't\nbecause you're \"frustrated,\" it's that\nyou're \"embarrassed\"?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "599040"
msgid "Bullseye, eh? A commander who prioritizes\ntheir pride meets a tragic end, y'know?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "599124"
msgid "I don't like saying it, but when a person's too\neasy to mess with, I can't really enj―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "599216"
msgid "Suddenly, #C236196003Archer#CDEF disappeared.\n#C236196003BB#CDEF waved her teacher's cane, and a black hole\nopened up beneath #C236196003Archer#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "599368"
msgid "…maybe they had a falling out."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "599400"
msgid "We didn't fall out. Useless Servants head to the\nintrospection room immediately.\nI just decided that now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "599508"
msgid "More importantly, Senpai. You've done quite\nwell. Talking has been banned, but you and\n#C236196003#SVT#CDEF are synchronized."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "599636"
msgid "More importantly, Senpai. You've done quite\nwell. Talking has been banned, but you and\n#C236196003#SVT#CDEF are synchronized."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "599764"
msgid "More importantly, Senpai. You've done quite\nwell. Talking has been banned, but you and\n#C236196003#SVT#CDEF are synchronized."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "599892"
msgid "More importantly, Senpai. You've done quite\nwell. Talking has been banned, but you and\n#C236196003#SVT#CDEF are synchronized."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "600020"
msgid "…hmph. Does this mean prohibiting your\nconversations wasn't enough pressure on you?\nWell, whatever."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "600124"
msgid "The \"Talking Ban\" is now cleared. Since I'm\na fair Game Master, I properly accept people\nwho survive long enough."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "600240"
msgid "If you rest, your vocal functions will recover.\nHow about cozying up in that private room of\nyours―the one I can't even sneak a peek into."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "600380"
msgid "Well, honestly, I was just killing some time.\nI'll leave the rest to #C236196003Rani#CDEF.\nI'll be attending to my own work."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "600508"
msgid "Reaaalllyy good work today, Senpai.\nPlease keep wandering around the\nunconquerable #C236196003Rani#CDEF's Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "600628"
msgid "…!\nJust like the #C236196003Green Archer#CDEF,\n#C236196003BB#CDEF disappeared into the open hole beneath her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "600740"
msgid "It's a shame that we couldn't corner her,\nbut we're exhausted right now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "600816"
msgid "I also want to head back to My Room for a bit\nto get rid of this talking ban, but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "600900"
msgid "I'm getting a rare reaction from it,\nso I was thinking that maybe #C236196003BB#CDEF was\nguarding it…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601004"
msgid "Go investigate that, then we can end the\nmission for today.\nWe'll trust you to retrieve the item."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601104"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF throws a glance towards the inner Labyrinth.\nI'm worried about our voices, but for the time\nbeing we have no issue coordinating ourselves.\nLet's continue our search a little longer."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601308"
msgid "Anyway I look at it, it looks like a chess set.\nWhat's an antique game like this doing here…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601404"
msgid "Wow. #C000246204Chess#CDEF in the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF?\nYet another tasteful thing in here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601504"
msgid "200 years after mankind's first counting machine\nwas created in 1642, Charles Babbage was devoted\nto making machines play games."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601636"
msgid "They say it was the beginning of thinking\nroutines. The topic became on chess."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601716"
msgid "Until the 20th century, the advancement of\ncomputers and computer chess seemed to be\nin parallel."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601816"
msgid "For this to be in #C236196003Rani#CDEF's Labyrinth means\nthat this is likely connected to her, but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601920"
msgid "That's a question for tomorrow that we'll\ntry asking her directly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601988"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF's mouth is frantically opening and\nclosing, but no voice is coming out."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "602084"
msgid "I can't believe this aggression… That broadcast\nlooked like a joke, but it's true!\n\"#C000246204Talking is prohibited#CDEF\"!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "602212"
msgid "We're looking for a way to undo this\n\"talking ban\" now.\n…what do you say, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "602312"
msgid "…it's no use. I thought it was just a type\nof abnormal status, but it looks like it's by\n#C236196003BB#CDEF's special authority… I can't remove it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "602464"
msgid "This is a problem… We haven't even caught hold\nof a clue to an #C000246204SG#CDEF, but now a bothersome\nrule has been forced on us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "602600"
msgid "But #C236196003BB#CDEF going out of her way to interfere with us\nmeans that getting past this floor is possible―\nI'm guessing that #C236196003Rani#CDEF's #C000246204SG#CDEF does exist."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "602788"
msgid "Regardless, the Student Council has no way\nto remove that talking ban right now.\nCan you even keep searching with it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "602908"
msgid "I look over to #C236196003#SVT#CDEF, but it doesn't look like\nthere's any objection.\nIt's a little inconvenient, but we… should be fine."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "603048"
msgid "Good. I think there's no need to worry about you\ntwo. So, please restart your search. We'll\ncontinue investigating countermeasures."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "603180"
msgid "As soon as I thought I heard a disturbing sound\nbeneath my feet, a sudden, poisonous mist gushed out.\nIt doesn't seem lethal, but my body instantly felt heavier."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "603344"
msgid "A trap…!?\nBut, it doesn't look like it was set in the\nLabyrinth from the very start."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "603432"
msgid "You mean someone set it afterwards?\nHm… #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, please keep going.\nMake sure to watch where you step."
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "603552"
msgid "――――――!?\n…………, ……!"
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "603584"
msgid "Did you get yourself paralyzed?\nPlease be careful not to get attacked in that state."
msgstr ""

